        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We expect any products that we develop and commercialize directly or with partners to compete on the basis of, among other things, the strength of clinical efficacy and safety data, price and the availability of reimbursement from government and other third-party payers.",
